<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40556" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίπλοος</span></b>  (A), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			contr.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίπλους</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ουν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιπλέω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sailing against</i>
			
			<i>the enemy</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῆες</span> `ships of
			the line', <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.50.6
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1.27.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				104.16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. <i>sailing
				after</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				20.50.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>. <i>on board
				ship</i>: as Subst., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιβάτης</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				276
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίπλοα</span>, τά, 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔπιπλα</span>
			 ad fin.</div>
